WEBVTT

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:13.490
Romeo's Blue Skies

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:12.930
"To the Sky..."

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:18.090
<i>Overlooking the rows of houses and stores</i>

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:22.500
<i>from the highest vantage,</i>

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:27.610
<i>Such things as tears and sadness</i>

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:31.750
<i>will quickly vanish</i>

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:37.310
<i>The birds, wind, and sunshine...</i>

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:41.500
<i>...all are your friends</i>

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:46.570
<i>I'll carry this dream farther than far</i>

00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:51.660
<i>...no matter the distance...</i>

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:58.420
<i>I long to fly freely</i>

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:02.700
<i>through the blue sky in my heart...</i>

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:05.630
<i>The far distant blue sky</i>

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:13.080
<i>It flows into tomorrow</i>

00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:25.390
Takara Fansubs

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:31.010
<i>The day of the banquet had finally arrived.</i>

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:38.550
<i>Romeo had a close call rescuing Alfredo from the Wolf Pack.</i>

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:42.140
<i>Giovanni, moved by Romeo and Alfredo's friendship,</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:48.620
<i>...agreed to join with the Black Brothers for one night only.</i>

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:53.630
Episode 28:

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:53.630
Lord Alfredo

00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:59.490
The King! The King is here!

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:08.240
Alfredo will almost certainly come here.

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:12.100
We heard it from the boy Michaelo, so there's no doubt about it.

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:14.500
Find him no matter what.

00:02:14.590 --> 00:02:16.220
And when you find him...

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:18.290
...kill him.

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:33.630
Ah! That's my cue.

00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:37.120
Open up!
- Open up!

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:41.300
What do you want?

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:43.330
The grocer sent us with these.

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:45.710
He said there weren't enough nuts for tonight.

00:02:45.730 --> 00:02:47.340
Please hurry!

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:51.140
Lorenzo? He didn't tell me about this...

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:53.250
Wait. I'll check on it.

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:55.080
There's no time for that!

00:02:55.120 --> 00:02:58.590
What'll happen if the King runs out of nuts at dinner?

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:02.240
Hey! Stop! Don't run in here!

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:08.260
Look what you did!

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:11.520
Wait... don't make such a fuss.

00:03:11.630 --> 00:03:14.230
Boy, is the cook gonna be mad at you.

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:26.340
That's Lomberto.

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:27.770
Lomberto?

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:30.480
He's one of Mauricio's bodyguards.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:33.760
Then that means they're looking for us.

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:35.530
What now, big brother?

00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:37.550
We've got to do it.

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:41.040
For our own sake, and for Romeo and the others.

00:03:41.260 --> 00:03:43.330
Yes.
- That's right.

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:45.950
We're all done over here.

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:48.020
Let's hurry up and get it done over there.

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:50.520
Don't move if you know what's good for you.

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:54.840
OK, let's go!

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:01.870
Let's sneak in through that tower.

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:05.240
I'll have a look. You stay here.

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:06.870
Be careful, big brother.

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:10.620
Found you.

00:04:14.630 --> 00:04:15.950
Say your prayers.

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:26.020
Sleep tight.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:27.520
Giovanni!

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:29.400
Hey, Alfredo.

00:04:30.260 --> 00:04:33.170
Giovanni... what are you doing here?

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:34.510
Alfredo.

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:36.120
Romeo!

00:04:36.230 --> 00:04:38.080
The Wolf Pack!

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:41.080
We hooked up with the Wolf Pack.

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:42.910
We're fighting together.

00:04:43.190 --> 00:04:45.180
With the Wolf Pack?

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:46.170
Yes.

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:49.980
Let's let bygones be bygones for tonight.

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:54.810
Alfredo, the Wolf Pack will do everything it can to protect you.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:58.820
What happened to you, Giovanni?

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:02.900
I didn't want anyone else to bring you down before I had the chance.

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:05.740
I'm the one who's going to defeat you.

00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:10.200
Alfredo, let's get moving. If we wait much longer it'll be too late.

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:12.950
Over here. Follow me.

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:18.290
The royal crypt is under here.

00:05:18.730 --> 00:05:21.480
We should be able to get into the house through it.

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:23.270
How'd you find that out?

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:25.600
Let's just say I've got a few acquaintances...

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:28.360
...who know more than they probably should.

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:29.770
Someone's coming.

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:31.640
There they are.
- Over there.

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:33.050
Get 'em!

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:38.560
I haven't felt my adrenaline pumping like this in ages.

00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:40.220
Protect Alfredo!

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:42.270
Protect Alfredo!

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:51.700
Those cocky brats...

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:54.300
...are in for it.
- Wait, let ME go.

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:58.110
I want to pay them back for what they did to me...

00:05:58.180 --> 00:05:59.550
...with interest!

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:10.630
Miss Bianca, are you okay?

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:13.350
I'm more than okay!
I'm perfectly fine!

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:14.980
Shh. They're coming closer.

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:20.290
Do it!

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:21.350
Pull!

00:06:21.410 --> 00:06:22.490
Pull!

00:06:27.170 --> 00:06:29.260
Way to go! One-to-nothing!

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:31.750
Those damn kids. Get 'em!

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:36.750
Take that.

00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:37.860
Take that.

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:45.880
Damn it!

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:53.240
Why, you...!

00:06:53.310 --> 00:06:54.500
Big brother!

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:05.100
You're pretty good, Romeo.

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:06.510
You're not so bad yourself.

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:08.340
It's not over yet.

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:12.000
There's one more left, and he doesn't look happy.

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:15.990
Get going, Alfredo.
I'll take care of things here.

00:07:16.210 --> 00:07:19.400
Romeo, go with them and protect them.

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:22.050
Yeah. We're counting on you, Romeo.

00:07:22.070 --> 00:07:22.820
And take this with you.

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:24.760
It may come in handy.

00:07:24.780 --> 00:07:25.330
But...

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:30.490
Don't worry about us.
We're here to protect Alfredo.

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:32.920
Alfredo... to the King!

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:34.680
To the King!

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:36.710
Thanks, everybody.

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:39.220
Nikita, show them the way.

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:41.690
Gotcha. Alfredo, this way.

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:43.610
Come on!

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:58.970
You okay, Bianca?

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:00.490
Yes... I'm sorry.

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:03.860
Hurry up, Alfredo.
No time for dilly-dallying.

00:08:19.070 --> 00:08:19.950
This way.

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:26.520
This staircase should lead up to the tower.

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:31.920
You kids have guts.

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:35.780
Give up now, or I'm through playing games.

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:40.050
I'm shakin'! Come on, I'm ready for you.

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:42.700
I won't let you lay a finger on Alfredo!

00:08:42.920 --> 00:08:44.490
We'll see about that.

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:58.970
Try this on for size!

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:05.980
You did it!

00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:08.840
You're one in a million, Giovanni.

00:09:09.300 --> 00:09:10.800
You said it.

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:12.100
You there!

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:16.620
What are you doing in here?

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:19.910
I draw the line at fighting real soldiers.

00:09:19.930 --> 00:09:20.660
Fall back!

00:09:22.730 --> 00:09:25.310
<i>Make it count, Alfredo.</i>

00:09:33.220 --> 00:09:36.750
I wonder if I said something I shouldn't have...

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:38.910
What should I do?

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:49.950
Aren't you Michaelo?

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:51.430
Madam Isabella!

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:54.470
I thought so...
Romeo's friend.

00:09:54.620 --> 00:09:56.650
Are you going to the banquet?

00:09:56.690 --> 00:10:01.450
Yes. Angeletta stayed behind in Paris.

00:10:02.230 --> 00:10:06.370
So, how are my heroes, Alfredo and Romeo?

00:10:07.270 --> 00:10:12.760
Please listen to me, Madame Isabella. They're...

00:10:12.870 --> 00:10:16.420
What? Alfredo is in the mansion?

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:19.370
I can't believe it.
- Believe it.

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:24.730
You're worthless! I'll go myself.

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:30.130
Alfredo... I should never have left him alive the night of the fire.

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:33.830
We're almost there, Alfredo.

00:10:33.850 --> 00:10:36.130
That bridge should lead us into the main building.

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:56.270
It's no good. We can't cross.

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:59.200
This iron gate only opens from the other side!

00:11:08.840 --> 00:11:11.390
We found them!
- We found them!

00:11:11.410 --> 00:11:12.890
They're up there!

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:14.940
In the tower!

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:18.890
They're coming. What do we do now, Alfredo?

00:11:20.190 --> 00:11:21.820
Big brother.

00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:05.880
There must be some way...

00:12:09.630 --> 00:12:11.630
All right, let's give it a shot.

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:20.540
What're you going to do, Romeo?

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:22.700
Watch.

00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:32.370
Okay... Done.

00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:34.250
Romeo, you're not going to...

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:38.190
Oh, yes, I am! We've got to risk it.

00:12:38.850 --> 00:12:40.460
Be careful, Romeo.

00:13:02.810 --> 00:13:03.780
This time for sure.

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:11.670
All right, pull the rope.

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:16.920
Hold it TIGHT.

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:19.150
You okay, Romeo?

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:21.370
Fine...

00:13:30.230 --> 00:13:31.250
Pull harder!

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:34.440
Hang on, Romeo!

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:36.270
You're almost there!

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:45.710
Why, those wily little...
- The kids are up there!

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:46.410
Fire!

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:49.170
They're trying to assassinate the King!

00:13:49.540 --> 00:13:51.060
Assassinate the King?

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:52.160
Holy...!

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:56.730
Don't let go.

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:07.020
Oh no! Romeo!

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:16.520
Don't move! Move and I'll shoot.

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:21.000
Romeo, hurry!

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:28.270
Over here.

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:32.370
Quickly!
- Hurry.

00:14:33.710 --> 00:14:35.370
That's it.

00:14:37.220 --> 00:14:38.630
Hurry up!

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:43.170
Keep going, and fast!

00:14:43.760 --> 00:14:46.500
Nikita!
- Go! Do you hear me?

00:14:46.870 --> 00:14:47.800
Thanks.

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:52.430
There!

00:14:55.070 --> 00:14:58.000
Hey! Open this door!
How dare you!

00:14:58.020 --> 00:14:59.170
How do you like them apples?

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:01.570
Stop, you!

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:10.570
Alfredo, we're almost there.

00:15:20.970 --> 00:15:23.200
Bianca, are you al...

00:15:23.220 --> 00:15:25.200
Romeo! Bianca's gone!

00:15:25.220 --> 00:15:26.040
What!?

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:30.120
Bianca!
- Bianca!

00:15:34.570 --> 00:15:35.960
That's Bianca's.

00:15:43.610 --> 00:15:44.600
Mauricio.

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:46.780
Let her go!

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:47.970
Or else I'll...

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:52.510
Shoot? Go ahead, if you dare.

00:16:02.300 --> 00:16:04.900
Throw down your gun, Alfredo.

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:16.560
I'll put an end to your suffering tonight.

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:19.820
Whoa, there!

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:23.480
You don't want me to cut up your lovely little sister's face...

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:24.690
...do you, Alfredo?

00:16:26.610 --> 00:16:28.950
You too, punk! Keep still!

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:34.040
Now get ready to rejoin your mother and father in Heaven.

00:16:36.380 --> 00:16:37.790
Big brother!

00:16:42.190 --> 00:16:43.250
Alfredo!

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:46.030
Tough luck.

00:16:48.560 --> 00:16:50.530
Alfredo.
- Don't move!

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:59.280
Mauricio, if you kill me now you won't get the Martini medal.

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:05.160
I don't need the medal anymore.

00:17:09.610 --> 00:17:12.130
So long, Alfredo.

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:13.850
Alfredo!

00:17:18.610 --> 00:17:20.390
Big brother!
- Romeo!

00:17:35.270 --> 00:17:38.050
Big brother!
- Bianca, let's go.

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:42.460
Did only one die...? Or did both?

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:50.170
Either way... no one will interfere with us anymore.

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:52.770
Mustn't keep the King waiting.

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:57.270
Uh...

00:17:57.510 --> 00:18:01.240
What is it?
- It's time to meet the King.

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:02.510
Very well.

00:18:02.780 --> 00:18:04.980
You'll find Alfredo down there.

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:08.310
Just to be on the safe side, finish him off.

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:10.050
And... oh, yes...

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:15.690
...capture Bianca and take the medal from her.

00:18:15.890 --> 00:18:16.310
Yes, sir.

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:19.420
Big brother!

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:20.500
Romeo!

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:23.500
Big brother!
- Romeo!

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:31.430
Snap out of it! You know those two can't be dead.

00:18:33.770 --> 00:18:36.110
Let's look for them.

00:18:36.190 --> 00:18:37.520
We're right here.

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:42.810
Big brother, Romeo!
Thank goodness.

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:44.420
You had us worried.

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:45.760
Sorry.

00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:48.120
Let's hurry, Alfredo.

00:18:52.090 --> 00:18:53.890
Damn!

00:18:54.290 --> 00:18:59.050
Archbishop Federico Pomelo of Milano!

00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:13.220
They're going to come here for sure. Don't let them get away.

00:19:13.240 --> 00:19:14.280
Right.

00:19:20.520 --> 00:19:23.800
The King! The King is in...

00:19:23.870 --> 00:19:25.370
Big brother!

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:31.120
What an awful thing to do!

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:32.050
Those kids...

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:35.820
Who are they?
- Where do they think they are?

00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:38.970
Let them go!

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:40.800
Shut up!
- That's enough!

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:44.830
It's Countess Monteverni!

00:19:45.230 --> 00:19:46.440
Unhand that boy.

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:50.910
That is Viscount Martini's son Alfredo...

00:19:50.930 --> 00:19:53.410
And his daughter, Bianca...

00:19:53.490 --> 00:19:56.230
Nobles, on whom you have absolutely no right to lay a hand!

00:19:57.700 --> 00:20:00.170
Hmph. Stop that!
- How rude!

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:02.690
How dare he do that to the Countess?

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:05.860
Take this rude person and throw him out of the mansion.

00:20:05.860 --> 00:20:06.870
Yes, ma'am.

00:20:06.920 --> 00:20:08.570
Come along.

00:20:09.010 --> 00:20:10.400
Move it!

00:20:10.580 --> 00:20:12.120
Let go!

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:14.500
What should we do with these boys?

00:20:15.070 --> 00:20:17.830
Those children are the dearest of friends.

00:20:18.470 --> 00:20:20.800
Friends of the Countess?

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:23.760
Madam Isabella.

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:24.880
Thank you very much.

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:27.790
It's been a while, Romeo.

00:20:28.140 --> 00:20:30.550
Michaelo explained everything to me.

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:34.560
I'll do everything I can to help you.

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:39.490
I owe you both a great debt, after all.

00:20:39.720 --> 00:20:42.210
Now let's go quickly to the King.

00:20:42.230 --> 00:20:43.990
Very well.
- Alfredo...

00:20:44.960 --> 00:20:46.700
It's time. Do it right.

00:20:47.210 --> 00:20:49.460
Thanks, Romeo. Here I go...

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:51.790
Let's go.

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:52.900
Yes.

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:56.490
Alfredo.

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:14.140
We are most honored to meet Your Majesty.

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:16.520
Your glorious Majesty.

00:21:17.560 --> 00:21:24.550
Martini, my father has told about that medal he gave you...

00:21:25.250 --> 00:21:29.570
It is our family treasure, Your Majesty.

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:31.690
It is a source of great pride in our family.

00:21:31.780 --> 00:21:34.330
That medal is a fake!

00:21:40.330 --> 00:21:42.530
The real medal is right here.

00:21:55.560 --> 00:21:59.220
<i>Alfredo goes before the King, with the truth in his heart.</i>

00:21:59.590 --> 00:22:04.530
<i>But Mauricio tries to trap Alfredo with a vicious lie.</i>

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:08.300
<i>Do your best, Alfredo.
We'll stand by you!</i>

00:22:08.740 --> 00:22:11.780
See you then!

00:22:08.740 --> 00:22:11.780
<i>Forever Alfredo</i>

00:22:08.740 --> 00:22:11.780
Next time:

00:22:13.040 --> 00:22:17.040
<i>"Si Si Ciao ~ On These Roman Roofs"</i>

00:22:25.650 --> 00:22:29.750
<i>Si Si Ciao, why do the good times</i>

00:22:29.850 --> 00:22:34.050
<i>seem to end so soon?</i>

00:22:34.250 --> 00:22:38.250
